Package: ibnetlens
Architecture: any
Depends: ${shlibs:Depends}, ${misc:Depends}
Suggests: infiniband-diags
Description: parse, validate and convert InfiniBand topology files
 ibnetlens reads the topology files written by ibnetdiscover, and the net files
 used by ibsim, and converts them to JSON, CSV, Graphviz or a Slurm tree
 topology.conf. It can also check a fabric for inconsistencies (duplicate
 GUIDs and LIDs, links without a matching reverse entry, mismatched or
 degraded link speeds) and compare two snapshots.
 .
 Parsing is single pass and multi-threaded; a 54 MB dump takes about 30 ms.
